> Insp[iration] can come from many places but this past weekend I found inspiration at the Arlene Abend Exhibit and Reception. The event was located at the Stone Quarry Hill Art Park in Cazenovia, New York and hosted by the Cazenovia Counterpoint. The Stone Quarry Hill Art Parks grounds are open daily from dawn to[ dusk] and has unique outdoor art throughout the[ 104 acres]. There are four miles of trails with breathtaking views.
